Description: A framework for speech corpora that stays compatible with emuR.
  It stores speaker and recording metadata at corpus, session and bundle level,
  uses that metadata to choose age- and gender-appropriate signal processing
  parameters, and keeps standards-compliant documentation files (README,
  CITATION.cff, DataCite, JSON-LD, CMDI) up to date for archiving and FAIR
  reuse.
